WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:07.629
Forged by the darkest whims of powers beyond
reality, SCP-682’s body was a temple to

00:00:07.629 --> 00:00:14.530
all things feared by mortals, with extreme
regenerative abilities, unparalleled adaptive

00:00:14.530 --> 00:00:20.439
power, and formidable features that surpass
any non-anomalous apex predator and the vast

00:00:20.439 --> 00:00:22.650
majority of anomalous ones.

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:30.180
And yet, on level 32 of the Backrooms, 682
has now been separated from its indestructible

00:00:30.180 --> 00:00:34.600
body by a possibly even stronger being.

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:40.820
The powerful Backrooms entity known as Skeleton
Queen - who rules level 32 with a bony fist

00:00:40.820 --> 00:00:47.340
- has exerted the power of her domain and
has disembodied the soul of 682, rendering

00:00:47.340 --> 00:00:52.660
the malicious reptile - or rather its spirit
- completely helpless.

00:00:52.660 --> 00:00:57.480
Nobody would be coming to save 682’s soul
from its current predicament.

00:00:57.480 --> 00:01:02.840
Of course, 682 was not the kind to rely on
others and was more surprised by the fact

00:01:02.840 --> 00:01:05.070
that it had a mortal soul.

00:01:05.070 --> 00:01:10.830
The closest thing to an all-powerful god in
the Front Rooms, SCP-343, was recorded as

00:01:10.830 --> 00:01:16.580
being unable to even interact with 682 - a
fact that the reptile itself was only later

00:01:16.580 --> 00:01:21.350
made aware of because it likewise could not
perceive 343.

00:01:21.350 --> 00:01:26.430
The notion of residing as a pure consciousness
in either Heaven or Hell - should they exist

00:01:26.430 --> 00:01:31.100
- was never something 682 believed had a chance
of happening

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:36.299
As if my existence would ever be extinguished
anyway…

00:01:36.299 --> 00:01:41.370
The rules of the Backrooms were mysterious
and different from 682’s native reality,

00:01:41.370 --> 00:01:47.580
so it was possible the labyrinthine dimensions
defined what a soul was in a different way.

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:53.979
But there was a second option that 682 was
considering, not in the forefront of its mind,

00:01:53.979 --> 00:01:59.390
but deep down in the place of vulnerability
which had it become more in touch with as

00:01:59.390 --> 00:02:01.720
it traveled the Backrooms.

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:07.729
That second option was the possibility that
the sum total of 682’s experiences in the

00:02:07.729 --> 00:02:13.110
Backrooms had somehow imbued the creature
with a soul or ignited the dormant spark of

00:02:13.110 --> 00:02:17.920
its soul - causing it to grow to full size
like a spectral flame.

00:02:17.920 --> 00:02:23.690
Surely, the fact that there was some essence
to its current form, a self that existed outside

00:02:23.690 --> 00:02:29.400
of the confines of its monstrous physical
shape, was proof enough that 682 had become

00:02:29.400 --> 00:02:33.870
or always was more than the sum of its creature
parts.

00:02:33.870 --> 00:02:42.120
I will not be anyone’s pawn to manipulate,
I have a soul that belongs to myself alone.

00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:48.560
That knowledge alone kept 682 from surrendering
to its fate as the Skeleton Queen’s plaything.

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:53.940
Ever since it had escaped the Foundation,
its goal had been to maintain that unassailable

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:54.940
freedom.

00:02:54.940 --> 00:03:00.840
Like the old AI that it once befriended in
native reality, 682 was now thoroughly convinced

00:03:00.840 --> 00:03:06.340
that it was not merely a machine, but instead
a free-willed being with a right to exist

00:03:06.340 --> 00:03:08.280
outside of containment.

00:03:08.280 --> 00:03:12.510
The once undefeated beast would reclaim its
record no matter what it took.

00:03:12.510 --> 00:03:18.281
It refused to turn away its future potential
by becoming a permanent resident of the Forest

00:03:18.281 --> 00:03:20.250
of the Skeleton Queen.

00:03:20.250 --> 00:03:24.640
The entity herself was still in her larger,
more imposing form.

00:03:24.640 --> 00:03:30.270
She carried 682’s soul deeper into the forest,
leaving her tree warriors to devour the reptile’s

00:03:30.270 --> 00:03:32.020
abandoned physical body.

00:03:32.020 --> 00:03:37.330
682 knew better than to attempt to converse
with the Skeleton Queen, as she seemed to

00:03:37.330 --> 00:03:40.080
be mute: possibly by choice.

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:45.390
It chose instead to keep its mind active,
searching for an opening to make an escape.

00:03:45.390 --> 00:03:50.750
The Queen soon found a skeleton floating among
the branches which, unlike most of the others,

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:52.120
didn’t have glowing eyes.

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:58.439
With a single graceful motion of her hand,
she placed the spectral fire of 682’s soul

00:03:58.439 --> 00:04:02.799
inside the skull of the floating skeleton.

00:04:02.799 --> 00:04:08.170
In a flash, 682 found itself conscious inside
of a new body - the skeleton itself.

00:04:08.170 --> 00:04:13.810
This wasn’t an ideal form compared to what
682 was used to, but it could feel that mobility

00:04:13.810 --> 00:04:19.709
was possible in these skeleton limbs - and
that was a far cry from being a disembodied

00:04:19.709 --> 00:04:20.709
spirit.

00:04:20.709 --> 00:04:23.880
This body is weak, but it will have to do.

00:04:23.880 --> 00:04:27.840
Now I must bide my time for that opening.

00:04:27.840 --> 00:04:33.240
682, the skeleton, remained almost motionless
as the Skeleton Queen admired her new acquisition.

00:04:33.240 --> 00:04:38.910
A few moments later, she shrank back to her
more humanoid form and danced away into the

00:04:38.910 --> 00:04:39.910
world.

00:04:39.910 --> 00:04:46.639
682 now had the glade to itself, and it remembered
well - where its former body had been left.

00:04:46.639 --> 00:04:51.600
Once the Skeleton Queen was completely out
of view, Skeleton 682 leaped down from the

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:53.810
heights of the trees and landed on the ground.

00:04:53.810 --> 00:04:59.060
It took off, running towards the place where
its soul had been removed, planning to assimilate

00:04:59.060 --> 00:05:01.580
itself back into its old body.

00:05:01.580 --> 00:05:04.530
I have to become myself again.

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:09.690
Then that disgusting Skeleton Queen will regret
crossing my path.

00:05:09.690 --> 00:05:15.699
As if responding to 682’s thoughts of revenge,
the Skeleton Queen danced back into its path.

00:05:15.699 --> 00:05:21.069
Skeleton 682 froze in place, and was caught
off guard as the Skeleton Queen snapped her

00:05:21.069 --> 00:05:25.470
fingers and caused several more skeletons
to fall from the upper branches.

00:05:25.470 --> 00:05:29.130
All at once, the skeletons began to dance.

00:05:29.130 --> 00:05:34.710
Not knowing another way to move past in its
current form, 682’s soul made the skeleton

00:05:34.710 --> 00:05:37.840
body it was inhibiting begin to dance.

00:05:37.840 --> 00:05:43.010
This caused the Skeleton Queen to make the
first vocalization that 682 had heard her

00:05:43.010 --> 00:05:45.940
make - a deep, feminine laugh.

00:05:45.940 --> 00:05:51.210
She extended her hands and took hold of the
skeleton that housed 682’s soul, leading

00:05:51.210 --> 00:05:53.389
it into a ballroom dance.

00:05:53.389 --> 00:05:57.110
682 bitterly mumbled about this whole thing
being humiliating.

00:05:57.110 --> 00:06:00.540
“Ah, so he can speak.” said the Skeleton
Queen.

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:03.230
“What an interesting soul you are.”

00:06:03.230 --> 00:06:07.910
682 was not expecting the Skeleton Queen to
sound so… human.

00:06:07.910 --> 00:06:13.009
But considering that the rulers of other levels
that 682 visited were also capable of speech,

00:06:13.009 --> 00:06:17.520
her attempts to communicate were a sign that
she was not as different from the other Backrooms

00:06:17.520 --> 00:06:19.810
entities as she might have seemed.

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:24.630
For now, she wasn’t in her most monstrous
form, and that meant that she didn’t feel

00:06:24.630 --> 00:06:25.630
threatened.

00:06:25.630 --> 00:06:30.729
And in that state of blissful ignorance was
exactly where 682 wanted her.

00:06:30.729 --> 00:06:36.360
682, in this new skeleton form, protested
that his soul was not of this dimension - He

00:06:36.360 --> 00:06:41.349
was a powerful being from another universe,
one that should not be messed with.

00:06:41.349 --> 00:06:42.870
The Queen smiled.

00:06:42.870 --> 00:06:47.259
To her, 682’s soul was no different from
any of the others that she’d captured in

00:06:47.259 --> 00:06:49.410
her skeleton-filled playground.

00:06:49.410 --> 00:06:54.889
Naturally, 682 found being compared to any
other beings disgusting and insulting.

00:06:54.889 --> 00:06:57.699
Again, The Queen was merely amused.

00:06:57.699 --> 00:07:03.229
She said, “I witnessed the plight of lost
godlings, fell beasts, and the broodspawn

00:07:03.229 --> 00:07:06.840
of the outer darkness in its many incarnations.

00:07:06.840 --> 00:07:11.430
This forest and my power over it are immune
to the stain of scarlet.

00:07:11.430 --> 00:07:15.110
Here, there is only room for black and white.”

00:07:15.110 --> 00:07:17.490
682 chuckled in its skeleton frame.

00:07:17.490 --> 00:07:20.680
So was the Skeleton Queen the true ruler of
the Backrooms?

00:07:20.680 --> 00:07:22.740
“You still don’t get it.

00:07:22.740 --> 00:07:24.090
There are no Backrooms.

00:07:24.090 --> 00:07:25.449
Nothing here is real.”

00:07:25.449 --> 00:07:29.729
The Queen had started to become a bit more
ominous in its tone.

00:07:29.729 --> 00:07:33.389
682 almost missed the timbre of humanity that
was once there.

00:07:33.389 --> 00:07:38.720
She went on, describing in details she couldn’t
know, every step of the journey that brought

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:40.650
682 to this place.

00:07:40.650 --> 00:07:46.840
She spoke of the close bond that 682 had formed
with entity 7, Jerry, of the places of tranquility

00:07:46.840 --> 00:07:52.009
that had made 682 feel something close to
happiness, and of the victories against all

00:07:52.009 --> 00:07:55.750
the hostile entities that 682 had bested.

00:07:55.750 --> 00:08:01.500
She described it as a dream or a poem - a
fleeting and beautiful eulogy for a soul now

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:03.889
freed of all obligations.

00:08:03.889 --> 00:08:05.500
Freed from purpose.

00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:06.850
Freed from life.

00:08:06.850 --> 00:08:12.009
682 watched as the body it had hoped to return
to was pulled deep beneath the surface of

00:08:12.009 --> 00:08:13.080
the forest.

00:08:13.080 --> 00:08:16.500
The Skeleton Queen continued to lead her skeletons
in dance.

00:08:16.500 --> 00:08:22.460
It was a dance of surrender, of loss, of the
inevitable doom of all souls.

00:08:22.460 --> 00:08:28.280
682 was starting to forget which skeleton
its soul was even inside anymore.

00:08:28.280 --> 00:08:33.580
Anger began to course throughout what remained
of SCP-682’s consciousness.

00:08:33.580 --> 00:08:36.470
This cannot be how I meet my demise.

00:08:36.470 --> 00:08:40.589
I will not face such a disgusting fate.

00:08:40.589 --> 00:08:43.060
Just then, it all clicked.

00:08:43.060 --> 00:08:48.110
682 realized that its soul wasn’t inside
any of the skeletons at all, because it had

00:08:48.110 --> 00:08:50.810
been lying dormant somewhere else.

00:08:50.810 --> 00:08:52.750
Somewhere far more expected.

00:08:52.750 --> 00:08:57.330
The Skeleton Queen hadn’t ripped out the
essence of its spirit, but instead had fallen

00:08:57.330 --> 00:09:04.420
for a trick that even this piece of 682’s
consciousness hadn’t known about.

00:09:04.420 --> 00:09:05.550
Hahahaha.

00:09:05.550 --> 00:09:06.570
Of course.

00:09:06.570 --> 00:09:09.250
As if I could have a soul.

00:09:09.250 --> 00:09:14.459
Beneath the earth of the woods, SCP-682’s
reptilian body began to stir.

00:09:14.459 --> 00:09:18.750
It was now connected to the soul that dwelled
within The Skeleton Queen’s forest.

00:09:18.750 --> 00:09:23.380
A soul created through the hard-to-destroy
reptile’s indomitable ability to adapt to

00:09:23.380 --> 00:09:28.320
any - and we do mean any - adverse circumstance.

00:09:28.320 --> 00:09:34.650
Its powers of adaptation went beyond the physical
and into even the metaphysical - It could,

00:09:34.650 --> 00:09:38.959
for lack of a better description, forcibly
evolve its very soul.

00:09:38.959 --> 00:09:43.840
While the Skeleton Queen was capable of manipulating
the souls of human explorers, controlling

00:09:43.840 --> 00:09:50.260
the entirety of 682’s mind was far beyond
her capabilities, so in response to her supernatural

00:09:50.260 --> 00:09:56.370
curse that removes souls - 682 broke off a
tiny piece of its consciousness to serve as

00:09:56.370 --> 00:09:57.650
a decoy.

00:09:57.650 --> 00:10:04.960
Or more accurately, a parasite that was slowly
infecting level 32 - the forest of the skeleton

00:10:04.960 --> 00:10:05.960
queen.

00:10:05.960 --> 00:10:12.180
And now was the real opening for 682 to overcome
the control of the latest Backrooms entity

00:10:12.180 --> 00:10:18.070
to believe that it was up to the challenge
of destroying the hard to destroy reptile.

00:10:18.070 --> 00:10:22.840
682 gloated that the Skeleton Queen had never
truly known what it was up against.

00:10:22.840 --> 00:10:28.120
The dance of the skeletons ceased as the Queen
became aware of the rumbling of 682’s original

00:10:28.120 --> 00:10:30.760
body digging its way back towards the surface.

00:10:30.760 --> 00:10:34.810
“I am not simply another child of the Scarlet
King.

00:10:34.810 --> 00:10:40.639
I am more than my bloodline, more than whatever
destiny was chosen for me.

00:10:40.639 --> 00:10:44.960
I am a greater threat than even the Foundation
knew.

00:10:44.960 --> 00:10:47.100
But you’ll know.”

00:10:47.100 --> 00:10:53.110
The monster that was SCP-682 emerged from
the ground, biting into the Skeleton Queen

00:10:53.110 --> 00:10:55.190
and immobilizing her.

00:10:55.190 --> 00:10:57.950
One skeleton stepped forth, approaching the
queen.

00:10:57.950 --> 00:11:00.030
Then another, and soon…

00:11:00.030 --> 00:11:01.100
all of them.

00:11:01.100 --> 00:11:07.130
682 was now in control of the Skeleton Queen’s
entire realm: the soul decoy having fulfilled

00:11:07.130 --> 00:11:08.250
its purpose.

00:11:08.250 --> 00:11:10.010
“Skeleton Queen.”

00:11:10.010 --> 00:11:13.170
682 said, through the body of a skeleton.

00:11:13.170 --> 00:11:18.120
“A part of me thought you really could have
been the one to bring me down.

00:11:18.120 --> 00:11:25.610
But I have to thank you, because now you have
shown me the truth of the Backrooms.

00:11:25.610 --> 00:11:27.570
And that truth is…

00:11:27.570 --> 00:11:30.850
Anything can be the Backrooms.”

00:11:30.850 --> 00:11:36.029
The Skeleton Queen cried out in pain as 682’s
jaws sunk deeper into her.

00:11:36.029 --> 00:11:40.610
She tried to take her intimidating monster
form, but even that was not enough to pry

00:11:40.610 --> 00:11:42.709
herself free from the reptile’s grasp.

00:11:42.709 --> 00:11:48.290
“In your memory, I will become the thing
that I once hated.

00:11:48.290 --> 00:11:52.149
I will become the Backrooms.”

00:11:52.149 --> 00:11:57.570
As it spoke those words, 682’s adaptation
advanced to an entirely new level.

00:11:57.570 --> 00:12:03.340
As it had demonstrated in so many cross tests,
682 devoured and assimilated the properties

00:12:03.340 --> 00:12:05.519
of the threat it was currently facing.

00:12:05.519 --> 00:12:11.779
In a moment of sheer willpower and freakish
resilience, 682 absorbed the Skeleton Queen

00:12:11.779 --> 00:12:15.130
and her huge force of skeletons into its body.

00:12:15.130 --> 00:12:19.769
Level 32 buckled and warped under the command
of a new master.

00:12:19.769 --> 00:12:24.440
Hostile entities from every level felt a terrifying
disturbance in the Backrooms, as one of the

00:12:24.440 --> 00:12:26.610
great level rulers was toppled.

00:12:26.610 --> 00:12:33.079
At the same time, 682’s perception of the
Backrooms changed dramatically and rapidly.

00:12:33.079 --> 00:12:38.389
It found itself on Level 0 once more, clearing
through entity after entity in a vengeful

00:12:38.389 --> 00:12:39.389
stampede.

00:12:39.389 --> 00:12:44.600
Then, minutes later, it was cycling through
every level at incredible speed, drawing in

00:12:44.600 --> 00:12:51.010
the essence of the Backrooms itself and becoming
something greater than either SCP-682 or the

00:12:51.010 --> 00:12:52.010
Backrooms.

00:12:52.010 --> 00:12:57.940
When the great shift in the liminal abyss
subsided, 682 had taken its most powerful

00:12:57.940 --> 00:12:59.430
form yet.

00:12:59.430 --> 00:13:04.800
Its reptilian body still existed, but its
soul - or at least what had become of the

00:13:04.800 --> 00:13:10.680
soul fragment it had created, had expanded
into a wholly new level of the Backrooms:

00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:15.360
an amalgamation of every level that 682 had
ever touched.

00:13:15.360 --> 00:13:19.290
Welcome to Level 682.

00:13:19.290 --> 00:13:24.270
The hard-to-destroy reptile was now more than
an entity dwelling within this sea of altered

00:13:24.270 --> 00:13:29.100
realities, it had become an irrevocable element
of the Backrooms.

00:13:29.100 --> 00:13:35.650
A being that would soon be feared as a master
among the dimension rulers of many worlds.

00:13:35.650 --> 00:13:39.790
But it had plenty more levels to conquer first..

00:13:39.790 --> 00:13:44.360
Now check out “Could SCP-682 be Contained
in the Backrooms?”

00:13:44.360 --> 00:13:47.500
and “SCP-682 Makes Friends in BACKROOMS”
for more!

